+/*
+ * MRES v2 writer (MRES-V2-SPEC.md). LAB CANDIDATE: `MRES` and `XR32` are
+ * experimental node tags.
+ *
+ * Works on the compiled paks rather than on .dat input, so the 1x and 2x art go
