+		//
+		// Inside the map every sprite is blended onto the tile's own opaque ground
+		// image, which is redrawn each frame, so drawing the same sprite again is
+		// harmless. Outside the map there is no tile and therefore no repaint, so
+		// the destination of the blend was whatever the previous frame left there:
+		// anything semi-transparent that overhangs the map edge - a tree, its
