+		// further from the background every frame, until some unrelated event
+		// happened to set background_dirty and reset it. Measured on a tester's
+		// recording: the affected pixels move monotonically away from the
+		// background colour over five frames and then snap back.
+		//
+		// This is what draw_outside_tile=1 does implicitly - it paints every
